---
import ContentPage from '../layouts/ContentPage.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config/site';
---

<ContentPage
  title="Terms of use"
  seoTitle="Terms of Use"
  description={`Terms for using ${SITE.brand} calculators and guides. Results are planning estimates; confirm with your supplier and local code.`}
  lede="Effective [Effective date]. By using this website you agree to these terms."
>
  <h2>Estimates only</h2>
  <p>
    The calculators and guides provide planning estimates for general information. They are not professional,
    engineering or legal advice and are not a substitute for a site visit, a supplier’s take-off or the product
    manufacturer’s instructions. Results depend on the measurements and assumptions you enter.
  </p>
  <p>
    Building codes vary by location and change over time. Confirm requirements with your local building department
    before you buy materials or start work.
  </p>

  <h2>No warranty</h2>
  <p>
    The site is provided “as is”, without warranties of any kind. We work to keep every formula accurate and tested, but
    we do not guarantee that results are complete, correct or suitable for your project.
  </p>

  <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
  <p>
    To the extent permitted by law, [Company legal name] is not liable for any loss arising from use of the site,
    including material shortfalls, over-ordering or project delays. [Have this clause reviewed for your jurisdiction.]
  </p>

  <h2>Safety</h2>
  <p>
    Working on roofs, ladders and structures is dangerous. Use appropriate fall protection and follow applicable safety
    regulations. Do not rely on this site for safety decisions.
  </p>

  <h2>Content and links</h2>
  <p>
    Site content is owned by [Company legal name]. You may share links to any page. Links to third-party sites are
    provided for convenience; we are not responsible for their content.
  </p>

  <h2>Governing law</h2>
  <p>These terms are governed by the laws of [Jurisdiction].</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p><a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a></p>
</ContentPage>
